The code was successful in executing without any errors and displaying the expected results. The function `transfer()` successfully performed money transfers between the accounts of two specified people. The code was designed to transfer an amount from a random account of the sender to a random account of the recipient while ensuring that the sender has enough money. It also handled cases where the sender does not have enough money and where an invalid transaction amount was--------------------    assert 0 < amnt <= 100, "Transfer amount must be between 1 and 100"
    
